<title>GERMANY: Hypo-Bank details H1 lending developments.</title>
<headline>Hypo-Bank details H1 lending developments.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH, Germany 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30.</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Group lending volume			264,100 up 4.3 pct</p>
<p>Of which</p>
<p>    --Bank lending				71,500  up 8.7 pct</p>
<p>--Mortgage and public sector lending  192,600 up 2.7 pct</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German mortgage specialist is Bayerische Hypotheken- und Wechsel-Bank AG. The bank plans to merge with fellow Bavarian bank Bayerische Vereinsbank AG to create Germany's second-largest commercial bank.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
